        ["BRANCH", "Note: a) The fee specified as above must be deposited in the accounts mentioned above via three separate transactions using online mode only. A proof of successful transaction must be provided clearly mentioning transaction number, credit account, date and amount. b) The admission in the hostel shall be provisional subject to verification of transaction. c) Hostel fee for students first admitted before 2023-24 in Dwarka hostels and seeking re- admissions in EDC Boys hostel shall be same as previous year. However other components shall be as above. d) All figures are in Indian rupees (INR) e) All transaction proofs must be certified by Indian bank branch at GGSIPU EDC before admission to the hostel. Page | Boys Hostel East Delhi Campus Admission Brochure 2026-27"],
        ["RULES FOR REFUND OF HOSTEL CHARGES", "1. If any resident vacates his seat within 02 months from his date of admission in the hostel, he shall be eligible for a refund of 50% of Hostel fee component. Except the above circumstance, Hostel fee component is non-refundable. 2. Mess and Hostel Security shall be refunded taking into considerations adjustments (if any) after the resident vacates his seat. Mess charges after necessary deductions of monthly bills will be refunded."],
        ["RULES FOR REFUND OF HOSTEL CHARGES", "3. Mess Security will be refunded if the student has cleared his last mess bill. Clearance has to be taken from the Hostel office. 4. Hostel Security Charges will be refunded only when a student leaves the Hostel and the same must be claimed within a year of leaving the hostel. The cost of the breakage or other dues, fine imposed if any, will be deducted from the hostel security and refund may be held up if other hostel dues have not been cleared."],
        ["RULES FOR REFUND OF HOSTEL CHARGES", "5. Mess maintenance and Welfare fee is non-refundable once paid. 6. A resident who later takes admission in the University School of Studies (USS) at the Dwarka Campus and is allotted accommodation in a Dwarka Campus Hostel shall submit an application for withdrawal from the East Delhi Campus Hostel. The withdrawal application shall be processed in accordance with the prescribed rules to facilitate the transfer of hostel accommodation. Page | Boys Hostel East Delhi Campus Admission Brochure 2026-27"],
