        ["GENERAL INFORMATION", "The University maintains two hostels in the East Delhi Campus, one for the male studentsandoneforthefemalestudentsoftheschoolssituatedattheEastCampus, Guru Gobind Singh Indraprastha University. The EDC GIRLS hostel infrastructure comprises the following room types: Eachroomisequippedwithbasicfurniturelike7ftx3ftcots,chairs,tables,Almirah,tubelight,fansand powerpointsetc.ForHygienicreasons,itisexpectedthateverystudentshouldbringherownmattress, pillows,Quilt,blanket,linen/bedsheet,waterbuckets,mugs,etc.Thehostelprovidescompulsorymess facilities for the residents. It is a concerted effort of the University to provide a wholesome hostel"],
        ["GENERAL INFORMATION", "facilityfortheresidentsandhelpthempursuetheirrespectiveacademicandprofessionalgoalstotheir best.Itisaconsistentendeavorofthehosteladministrationtofollowthewell-establishedethosofhostel life and promote a healthy community atmosphere in the hostel. Ragging, violence, negative discrimination, consumption/possession of alcoholic, tobacco products or narcotic substances is strictly prohibited in the hostels. Page | Girls’ Hostel EastDelhi Campus Admission Brochure 2026-27 Single Seated Room (For PG and PhD students) Triple Seated Room Four Seated Room Total Seats"],
